{
  "id": "zetru-brands",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "updated": "2026-11-22",
  "notes": [
    "Official domains: a host is official when it equals a listed domain or is a subdomain of it.",
    "sending_domains: domains this brand sends mail from. link_domains: further domains it links to. Freemail and user-generated hosting domains are never listed as sending domains.",
    "tokens: case-insensitive whole-word display tokens (compared after NFKC, case folding and UTS #39 skeleton). tokens_cs: case-sensitive acronyms.",
    "labels: registrable labels used for the Damerau-Levenshtein and same-label-other-suffix look-alike rules. token_rule: whether a label as a whole hyphen/dot token in a foreign host counts as a look-alike (rule 4).",
    "regional: group brands whose members use many regional domains (pattern on the registrable label, allowed TLDs). Matching domains are treated as 'cannot judge' and are never flagged by the server.",
    "authority_suffixes: for authorities, government domains under which any subdomain is accepted as official.",
    "review: entries or values that need human verification before relying on them; they are used conservatively (only to suppress findings, never to raise risk on their own)."
  ],
